   "date": "2018-02-16T14:09:27Z",
   "subject": "Re: WARNING : Removed records without environmental values",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div><div dir=\"auto\">Thanks for using Wallace! The issue here is that Worldclim data at the 30 arsec resolution is downlodable through R only by tile. Thus, we can only allow downloads of single tiles of 30 arcsec data currently. If you want to use a bigger extent, download the full global dataset, crop it in ArcGIS or QGIS (cropping big rasters is not recommendable in R), then input this data into Wallace as User-specified Environmental Data.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Jamie</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
